<title>USA: AMEX closing averages.</title>
<headline>AMEX closing averages.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-06-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prices on the American Stock Exchange closed lower in heavy trading.</p>
<p>The Amex Composite index closed at 619.24, down 0.62.</p>
<p>The average price per share fell $0.04.</p>
<p>Decliners beat advancers 303 to 270.</p>
<p>Preliminary volume was 25,341,335 compared with 25,683,890 on Tuesday.</p>
<p>(Prices official as of 1630 EST/2130 GMT)</p>
<p>((-- Wall Street desk, 212-859-1830))</p>
